ld  just be a corpse and that would be weird  but they're not going to take them from  any other place it's going to be right  before they died but it does seem to be  different for andrew and toby which  makes you wonder how everybody is  exactly going to be taken from their  universe and brought into the mcu is it  the spell that does it or could it be  something else like the events of loki  could have possibly affected it we're  unsure as of now but it's nice to know  that toby is going to basically be  looking the same way in the same suit  that he wore in spider-man 3 which i  actually really really like that they're  doing that because if he changes his  suit i'd like to see him change his suit  much like tom holland spider-man did in  far from home because if you're not  going to give us a reason as to why it  changed keep the suit the same so i like  that he's going to be the same but he's  going to be the older more mature  spider-man and hopefully he's going to  be kind of the leader of the other two  spider-man when they go into battle  hopefully he'll show them the ropes or  the webs so toby with a beard incoming  and also relating to the spider-man no  way home trailer spider-man no way home  updates and leaks also posted that the  second spider-man knowing home trailer  is coming before eternals that's why the  photos dropped referring to the official  photos that we got from entertainment  weekly last week the tweet continues to  say shots were decided long ago it's  been finished as of now we'll go into  dubbing soon and this is just more  evidence pointing towards a date around  or on the 25th of this month hopefully  now as far as that last villain of the  sinister six is confirmed you've heard  me mention rhino before at the moment  those were kind of just rumors however  as of now we have gotten a leaked photo  of rhino now as far as i'm concerned  this photo seems to be pretty legitimate  so i can't post it on the channel but  basically it show